  "details": "How about, Whenever you meet a person you don't have on your friends list, it automatically downloads their model, and when u leave the world, if u haven't added that person, it would automatically remove it from the cache, that way your cache wont be so stacked and make you lag so bad, I personally have to delete my cache once a week at least to get rid of lag. (could also be when you close the game, Or maybe a button thats called \"Remove cache\" that will remove models from people who are not your friends.)",
